{"title":"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> the operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/3/a936fcadfbb226c57a6143c0d75eca294be0b370.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\spadesuit (x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" /> is defined as \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/c/29c8e1b1ec789c2d4943123570f9dccf63d5c69d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\spadesuit (x,y) = x-\\dfrac{1}{y}\\]\" width=\"124\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/1/611db582d7c902ecf7d5c3ceca9bf4dc04138a42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\spadesuit (2,\\spadesuit (2,2))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/0/6a0b457368bc70ec862ddcc0205779190fef4124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{2}{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{4}{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{5}{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"354\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3ea682e5f73999b3ed73223f9df1f797b6ac86f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\spadesuit (2,2) =2-\\frac{1}{2} =\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"159\" height=\"37\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/b/39b5f71d8432b765b86674d66990324b8323b276.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\spadesuit \\left(2,\\frac{3}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"75\" height=\"45\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/a/99a168b99a978fb5d9083047bdf327f172295723.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-\\frac{1}{\\frac{3}{2}} = 2- \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"150\" height=\"43\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/640f9a729e2bc1e9b42281e136ec705d57892f30.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\spadesuit (x, y) \\text{is defined as } x - \\frac{1}{y} \\text{. Hence } \\spadesuit (2,\\spadesuit(2, 2)) =2 - \\frac{1}{\\spadesuit (2, 2)} =  2 - \\frac{1}{2 - \\frac{1}{2}}=2-\\frac{1}{\\frac{3}{2}}=2-\\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{4}{3}\\Longrightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } \\frac{4}{3}}\\]\" width=\"808\" height=\"49\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/P7rGLXp_6es\">https://youtu.be/P7rGLXp_6es</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\